{"id":"n24959-2-7","stage":2,"title":"곱다 · 美","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24959-2-7-1","ko":"와, 벌써 산에 단풍이 붉게 물들었어.","zh":"哇，山上的树叶已经染红了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"산에","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산에","audio":"/audio/e15e1da2e3c81b9f81cf.mp3"}},{"text":"단풍이","meaning":"秋叶、变红或变黄的树叶","explanation":"단풍 指秋天树叶变红、变黄的现象或这些树叶；这里不必限定为枫树的叶子。","readings":[{"term":"단풍","audio":"/audio/d3e79a469b1eb10515e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28378","senseId":"1","lemma":"단풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단풍이","audio":"/audio/16be409478ed1996ee1a.mp3"}},{"text":"붉게","meaning":"红，赤","explanation":"붉다：红，赤；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"붉다","audio":"/audio/b85946cfacf334e3f2a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71058","senseId":"1","lemma":"붉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붉게","audio":"/audio/85b5fd4937e548c4ea4e.mp3"}},{"text":"물들었어.","meaning":"染色","explanation":"물들다：染色；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"물들다","audio":"/audio/2bd73104dcaef3ec3fbc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56195","senseId":"1","lemma":"물들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물들었어","audio":"/audio/b3489b06531716c7a9a1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]},{"id":"d3e79a469b1eb105","term":"단풍","zh":"秋叶、变红或变黄的树叶","audio":"/audio/d3e79a469b1eb10515e0.mp3","entryId":"28378","definition":"秋叶、变红或变黄的树叶","pronunciation":["단풍"]},{"id":"b85946cfacf334e3","term":"붉다","zh":"红，赤","audio":"/audio/b85946cfacf334e3f2a1.mp3","entryId":"71058","definition":"颜色像鲜血或熟了的辣椒一样。","pronunciation":["북따"]},{"id":"2bd73104dcaef3ec","term":"물들다","zh":"染色","audio":"/audio/2bd73104dcaef3ec3fbc.mp3","entryId":"56195","definition":"色彩慢慢地扩散或沾染而着色。","pronunciation":["물들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a2f3e94a8de3dcae08c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24959-2-7-2","ko":"그러게. 정말 곱게 물들었네.","zh":"是啊，颜色真漂亮呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"곱게","meaning":"美，美丽","explanation":"곱다：美，美丽；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{